{"title": "Voice of Reason (Condition)", "pageid": 46393, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Voice_of_Reason_(Condition)", "categories": ["No stack ID", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Voice_Of_Reason_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Voice_Of_Reason_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/Voice_Of_Reason_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Voice_Of_Reason_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/Voice_Of_Reason_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Voice_Of_Reason_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Voice Of Reason Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Voice_Of_Reason_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Voice_Of_Reason_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/bd/Voice_Of_Reason_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Voice of Reason</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Your Oath echoes in your mind, keeping <a href=\"/wiki/Auntie_Ethel\" title=\"Auntie Ethel\">Auntie Ethel's</a> whispers at bay - for now. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>UID: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">HAG_MASK_CONTROLIMMUNE</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:HAG_MASK_CONTROLIMMUNE+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:HAG_MASK_CONTROLIMMUNE+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Paladin\" title=\"Paladin\">Paladins</a> can get this condition if they pass <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;15 Charisma Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;15 <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a> when they first wear the <a href=\"/wiki/Whispering_Mask\" title=\"Whispering Mask\">Whispering Mask</a>.</li>\n<li>Although the effect is described as your oath echoing in your mind, the check also happens for <a href=\"/wiki/Oathbreaker\" title=\"Oathbreaker\">Oathbreaker</a> paladins.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202432\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.041 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.045 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 876